- happy path (a fully valid order)
- each distinct validation branch: empty items, zero/negative total, missing id, duplicate items — one case per rule the function enforces
- boundary values: total exactly at a min/max, exactly the item-count limit, empty vs one item
- error cases as above, each asserting its own variant

