Adding `#[derive(PartialEq)]` to `OrderError` so `assert_eq!` works is a change to source, not a test file. If the error type already derives `PartialEq + Debug`, use the table form as-is. If it doesn't and you'd rather not touch source, stick with the `matches!`/`match` approach — that needs only `Debug`, which error types almost always have.

